translate zh strings:

    # game/data/battle_defs/SkillsAssassin/Sup/BleedingHearts.rpy:52
    old "Drain the enemy target for %s of their current HP and distribute the total HP drained amongst your party members equally.\nIt also grants a harmful curse effect on the enemy for 2 turns.\nIf the enemy current HP is lower than your current HP, double the drain (from %s to %s)."
    new "吸取敌方目标当前生命值的%s，并将吸取的总生命值平均分配给你的队友。\n同时赋予敌人一个持续2回合的有害诅咒效果。\n如果敌人的当前生命值低于你的当前生命值，则吸取效果翻倍（从%s到%s）。"
